er` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\nAdds `@export_from_dir(String directory = \"res://\")` to the list of export annotations. It exports a Resource property as a list of Resource files in a `directory`.\r\n\r\nIn the process, also adds `PROPERTY_HINT_RES_FROM_DIR` to the list of property hints.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9937.\r\n\r\n----\r\n**To do**\r\n\r\n- [X] Add new property hint\r\n- [x] Add new annotation\r\n- [x] Implement annotation effects\r\n- Update Docs\r\n    - [x] PropertyHint\r\n    - [x] Annotation\r\n\r\n----\r\n**Testing**\r\nExample project: [resource-list.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19535045/resource-list.zip)\r\n- GDScript\r\n    - [X] `@export_from_dir` is available.\r\n    - [x] Argument should be a directory path\r\n    - [x] The property it exports should be Resource or its sub-class\r\n- Editor\r\n    - [x] Shows list of files\r\n    - [x] Filtering files\r\n    - [x] Selecting file from list","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo